"""Art for the Yggdrasil HUD style, traced from the Figma mockup
(file "Valheim", slide 41 = four food slots, slide 40 = three).

Figma frame is 1920x1080 and 1 Figma px = 1 HUD canvas unit at 1080p
(GuiScaler: scale = min(w/1920, h/1080)). Layers cover the screen area
x 0..440, y 640..1080 and are rendered at 2x.

Writes ../Icons/:
  ygg_back.png, ygg_back3.png    white blade between the bars (below everything)
  ygg_front.png, ygg_front3.png  branch frame around the food diamonds, ornaments,
                                 + and lightning signs (above diamonds and bars)
  ygg_slot.png                   rounded slot outline for ExtraSlots panels
  ygg_slot_marks.png             four arrows around the equipped ammo slot
  ygg_ammo.png, ygg_ammo_tip.png flat arrow glyph and its tintable tip
"""
